# All field / survey data — may contain confidential site information
data/*

# Exception: small AMT/MT lines used as bundled sample data for the
# pycsamt.emtools sphinx-gallery examples (docs/source/emtools/examples/).
# Only L18PLT and L22PLT of WILLY_DATA are tracked — L26PLT/L30PLT/L34PLT
# stay ignored (usable locally, never committed) to keep the repo small.
# (Re-excluding each level with "dir/*" — not a bare "dir/" — is required so
# git still descends far enough to see the nested "!" re-includes below.)
!data/AMT
data/AMT/*
!data/AMT/WILLY_DATA
data/AMT/WILLY_DATA/*
!data/AMT/WILLY_DATA/L18PLT
!data/AMT/WILLY_DATA/L22PLT
!data/AMT/WILLY_DATA/README.md

!data/MT
data/MT/*
!data/MT/kap03lmt_edis
!data/MT/README.md

# Exception: de-identified copies of two real cross-power-spectra EDI
# files, used as bundled sample data for the emtools.spectra gallery.
# The originals (HBH03.edi, ZBR02.edi) are real private field data and
# must never be tracked — only these sanitized, renamed copies are.
!data/MT/SPECTRA
data/MT/SPECTRA/*
!data/MT/SPECTRA/spectra01.edi
!data/MT/SPECTRA/spectra02.edi
!data/MT/SPECTRA/README.md

# Exception: compact ModEM result subset used by inversion-gallery examples.
# The complete production result directory is large and remains local-only;
# this folder keeps only controls, logs, input data, and three representative
# iteration snapshots for result-loading and convergence examples.
!data/modem
data/modem/*
!data/modem/willy_27freq_watex_line02_sample
!data/modem/willy_27freq_watex_line02_sample/**

# Inversion-plot runs (rendered PNGs, ~18 MB) are local-only outputs and
# must never be committed — GitHub repo-size hygiene. ``data/*`` already
# ignores them; the previous "!" exception that tracked 27-frequ-watex-
# data-02 was removed and the folder untracked (kept locally for testing).
# Likewise data/iter2dat (Occam iteration exports) is a local-only output.

# Demo scripts and generated figures — committed separately when stable
examples/

# Exception: sphinx-gallery example *source* scripts under
# docs/examples/<section>/ — hand-written, not generated, and must be
# tracked so the gallery can be rebuilt from a checkout. The generated
# gallery (docs/source/examples/) stays ignored via the rule above.
!docs/examples/
!docs/examples/**
# ...but the "!" above re-includes everything, so re-exclude the compiled
# caches it would otherwise track (the global __pycache__ rule is overridden
# inside a force-included tree).
docs/examples/**/__pycache__/
docs/examples/**/*.py[cod]

# C&G paper submission files — not for public distribution
/cag-paper/

# Reviewer-response handoff artifacts — local drafts/results for students
/QUESTIONS-TO-ANSWERS.md
/docs/reviewer_response_emtools.tex
/results/reviewer_response_emtools/
/pycsamt/pycsamt-project.zip

